WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Begin from the dashboard.
Read the schedule, then choose Clock in when you are ready.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:18.200 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Acknowledge a late start.
If prompted, add the reason and confirm the clock-in explicitly.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.967 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Pause when you take a break.
Choose Pause. In a connected app, wait for Worktivity to confirm it.

00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:29.733 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Resume when you return.
The companion shows the active shift again after confirmation.

00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:40.383 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Finish your shift deliberately.
Clock out asks for confirmation. Your tasks and EOD remain separate.
